    "note": "<b>Thursday brings September PCE, Amazon's results and the first trade in Alphabet after its miss.</b> PCE arrives with crude back above $100 and a long end that sold off after the Fed. Amazon is the third hyperscaler in two days to be judged on spending and cash. Then the Duo's second wave on Friday, <b>Palantir on 2 November</b> and the <b>midterms on the 3rd</b>."
